        </h2>
        <p>
          The <code class="text-emerald-400 font-mono">strategy.matrix</code> keyword allows developers to spawn a fleet of independent runner jobs from a single job specification. Each array defined under <code class="text-slate-200 font-mono">matrix</code> acts as a dimension; the workflow engine computes the mathematical Cartesian product of all dimensions.
        </p>
